drpm
------------------------------------------
Library for making, reading and applying deltarpm packages

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libdrpm-devel-0.5.3-1bl2
  libdrpm0-0.5.3-1bl2
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libzstd1-1.5.7-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  rpm-4.18.0-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libcmocka-devel-2.0.2-1
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libzstd-devel-1.5.7-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  rpm-devel-4.18.0-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rpm-software-management/drpm

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rpm-software-management/drpm/archive/refs/tags/0.5.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack drpm-0.5.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./drpm-0.5.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/drpm-0.5.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/drpm-0.5.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdrpm0-0.5.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdrpm-devel-0.5.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(drpm)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/drpm.README
  /usr/share/doc/drpm/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/drpm/LICENSE.BSD

(libdrpm0)
  /usr/bin/cygdrpm-0.dll

(libdrpm-devel)
  /usr/include/drpm.h
  /usr/lib/libdrpm.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/drpm.pc

